  << /ActualText (Introduction  \133\1762 minutes\135\n\nHi\054 my name is \137\137\137\137\056 Thank you for joining us today\056 We are grateful for your participation\056 We are working on a class project researching parents who plan to re\055enter\054 or have re\055entered\054 the workforce after taking a caregiving career break\056 We have prepared a 35\055minute interview with 10 short questions\056\nBefore we get started\054 would you mind if we record our session so we can reference it later\077 If you need to take a break at any time\054 feel free to let us know\056)
